<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-1236] Upgrade org.slf4j:slf4j-api:1.7.2 to 1.7.12</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-1236</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Hi, I found two versions of library&#160;org.slf4j:slf4j-api in your project. It would be nice to keep the version consistency.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Their introduced path is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;org.apache.parquet:parquet-format:2.4.1-SNAPSHOT::null-&amp;gt;org.slf4j:slf4j-api:1.7.2::compile&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;org.apache.parquet:parquet-format:2.4.1-SNAPSHOT::null-&amp;gt;org.apache.thrift:libthrift:0.9.3::compile-&amp;gt;org.slf4j:slf4j-api:1.7.12::compile&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&#160;Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Regards,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160; &#160; Panda&lt;/p&gt;</description>
